{"report_id":"qvwdb","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"The writer recounts personally experienced flashback episodes, including a detailed one this morning, with perceptual and affective changes.","scenes":[{"place":"","order":1,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":["crystalline quality","over-sharpened vision"],"material":["crystalline"],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["episode this morning"],"affect":["weird cold goose-bumpy feeling","sense of being seen into"],"quotes":[{"text":"My vision goes all funny like when you overuse the Sharpen filter in Photoshop, and starts taking on that crystalline quality.","start":498,"end":624,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I get that weird, cold, goose-bumpy feeling, and a sense of the Great and Terrible Truth looking into my soul.","start":626,"end":736,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":["other:crystalline quality","other:over-sharpened vision"],"material":["crystalline"],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:weird cold goose-bumpy feeling","other:sense of being seen into"],"transition_trigger":["other:episode this morning"],"place":"other:"}},{"place":"shower at home","order":2,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["got dressed and sat at computer"],"affect":["worried","out of sorts"],"quotes":[{"text":"In the shower I started to get worried but I didn't know what about, just a little out of sorts.","start":846,"end":942,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:worried","other:out of sorts"],"transition_trigger":["other:got dressed and sat at computer"],"place":"other:shower at home"}},{"place":"at my computer / walking around room","order":3,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["walking around"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["body got very heavy, staggered to bed"],"affect":["spiritual epiphany","horror","terror"],"quotes":[{"text":"That's when shit got hyperreal.","start":1028,"end":1059,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I got up from the computer and found myself in the midst of a DMT trip that was coming on harder and harder.","start":1142,"end":1250,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I had that overwhelmingly intense feeling of spiritual epiphany. And horror.","start":1356,"end":1432,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"\"Oh crap, I'm DYING again! I HATE dying!\"","start":1571,"end":1612,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["other:walking around"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:spiritual epiphany","other:horror","other:terror"],"transition_trigger":["other:body got very heavy, staggered to bed"],"place":"other:at my computer / walking around room"}},{"place":"bed","order":4,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["staggering","unsteady"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":["body very heavy"],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["grabbed book and began to read"],"affect":["panic attack","certainty of visiting Hell","abject terror","amusement"],"quotes":[{"text":"Suddenly my body got very heavy and I was not so steady on my feet.","start":1616,"end":1683,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I was also beginning to have a panic attack, because I was possessed of a certainty that if I was to phase out of this world I would be paying Hell a visit.","start":1774,"end":1930,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"Even in my grimmest moment of abject terror I saw the amusing connection.","start":2231,"end":2304,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["other:staggering","other:unsteady"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":["other:body very heavy"],"scale":[],"affect":["other:panic attack","other:certainty of visiting Hell","other:abject terror","amusement"],"transition_trigger":["other:grabbed book and began to read"],"place":"other:bed"}},{"place":"lying on bed reading","order":5,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":[],"affect":["Ultimate Cosmic Knowing","positivity","bemused","worry about next time"],"quotes":[{"text":"I still had that powerful feeling of Ultimate Cosmic Knowing, and I once again embraced all the world as self and focused on positivity to keep the anxiety down.","start":2508,"end":2669,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"Eventually the flashback faded and I lay there, bemused.","start":2670,"end":2726,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:Ultimate Cosmic Knowing","other:positivity","other:bemused","other:worry about next time"],"transition_trigger":[],"place":"other:lying on bed reading"}}],"flags":["unmapped:/scenes/0/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/0/affect","unmapped:/scenes/0/transition_trigger","empty_descriptor:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/affect","unmapped:/scenes/1/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/2/motion","unmapped:/scenes/2/affect","unmapped:/scenes/2/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/2/place","unmapped:/scenes/3/motion","unmapped:/scenes/3/density","unmapped:/scenes/3/affect","unmapped:/scenes/3/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/3/place","unmapped:/scenes/4/affect","unmapped:/scenes/4/place"],"schema_version":"0.4.0","_extraction":{"job":"batch-59654eaa6311400fa00712ac545b9d80","phase":"pilot20","attempt":10}}
{"report_id":"s3i3v","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"Amid lengthy philosophical commentary, the writer recounts a specific personal experience with faces, colours and three figures.","scenes":[{"place":"original surroundings transformed","order":1,"light":[],"colour":["colossal colors"],"motion":["raging","chaotic"],"geometry":["complex patterns"],"material":[],"density":["faces cover every surface"],"scale":["colossal"],"beings":[{"form":["beautiful faces"],"count_text":"beautiful faces cover ever surface","behaviour":["smiled","seemed uninterested in me"],"communication":[],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:beautiful faces"],"behaviour":["other:smiled","other:seemed uninterested in me"],"communication":[],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":["staring at the ceiling as they came into view"],"affect":["awe","disbelief"],"quotes":[{"text":"What I saw can only be described as Heavenly, Divine, Advanced yet Angelic...","start":6537,"end":6614,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"like being taken from my original surroundings and tossed into a carnival of colossal colors raging into a fit of chaos","start":6654,"end":6773,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"beautiful faces cover ever surface as did complex patterns. They faces smiled, and seemed to not really be interested in me.","start":6822,"end":6946,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":["other:colossal colors"],"motion":["other:raging","other:chaotic"],"geometry":["other:complex patterns"],"material":[],"density":["other:faces cover every surface"],"scale":["other:colossal"],"affect":["awe","other:disbelief"],"transition_trigger":["other:staring at the ceiling as they came into view"],"place":"other:original surroundings transformed"}},{"place":"","order":2,"light":[],"colour":["colossal colors"],"motion":["drifted","raged even harder","vanished into walls","sank into floors"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[{"form":["Three figures","two were feminine, the other was masculine"],"count_text":"Three figures","behaviour":["watching me, aware of me","waved his finger at me","gently touched my conscious skin","reached through me","slowly vanish into the walls, and sank into the floors"],"communication":["they greeted me","in a way telling me I wasn't in control"],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:Three figures","other:two were feminine, the other was masculine"],"behaviour":["other:watching me, aware of me","other:waved his finger at me","other:gently touched my conscious skin","other:reached through me","other:slowly vanish into the walls, and sank into the floors"],"communication":["other:they greeted me","other:in a way telling me I wasn't in control"],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":[],"affect":["disbelief","letting go","understanding"],"quotes":[{"text":"Three figures watching me, aware of me, two were feminine, the other was masculine.","start":7144,"end":7227,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"but the male figure waved his finger at me, in a way telling me I wasn’t in control","start":7263,"end":7346,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"the two feminine figures gently touched my conscious skin","start":7531,"end":7588,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I became engulfed in energy with information, answering everything","start":7754,"end":7820,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"my body no longer existed","start":7117,"end":7142,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I watched as they slowly vanish into the walls, and sank into the floors","start":7964,"end":8036,"anchor_sco