{"report_id":"hvbtm","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"The writer recounts a personal experience tonight of a presence erupting into shifting patterns and faces, despite ending with a question.","scenes":[{"place":"","order":1,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[{"form":["vaguely external presence"],"count_text":"","behaviour":["lurking over my shoulder"],"communication":[],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:vaguely external presence"],"behaviour":["other:lurking over my shoulder"],"communication":[],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":["closing eyes and letting go"],"affect":["surprise"],"quotes":[{"text":"I simply closed my eyes and let myself be swept away by the experience.","start":974,"end":1045,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I felt what in previous trips had been only a vaguely external presence (almost like the feeling of someone lurking over my shoulder)","start":1063,"end":1196,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["surprise"],"transition_trigger":["other:closing eyes and letting go"],"place":"other:"}},{"place":"hyperspace","order":2,"light":[],"colour":["colors"],"motion":["constantly changing","shifting and moving in ways that defy motion as I understand it"],"geometry":["strictly ordered pattern of shapes"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[{"form":["pattern of shapes and colors with many faces"],"count_text":"the beings","behaviour":["shifting and moving","slipping away"],"communication":[],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:pattern of shapes and colors with many faces"],"behaviour":["other:shifting and moving","other:slipping away"],"communication":[],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":["stopping trying to resonate with the carrier frequency"],"affect":["absolute strangeness"],"quotes":[{"text":"this presence erupted as a strictly ordered yet constantly changing pattern of shapes and colors with many faces that kept shifting and moving in ways that defy motion as I understand it","start":1212,"end":1398,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"as soon as I stopped trying to resonate with the carrier frequency, I felt the beings slipping away","start":1505,"end":1604,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I felt like I could actually will myself in and out of hyperspace","start":1665,"end":1730,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"there was definitely something very objective about what I was seeing","start":2039,"end":2108,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":["other:colors"],"motion":["other:constantly changing","other:shifting and moving in ways that defy motion as I understand it"],"geometry":["other:strictly ordered pattern of shapes"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:absolute strangeness"],"transition_trigger":["other:stopping trying to resonate with the carrier frequency"],"place":"hyperspace"}}],"flags":["unmapped:/scenes/0/transition_trigger","empty_descriptor:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/0/beings/0/form","unmapped:/scenes/0/beings/0/behaviour","unmapped:/scenes/1/colour","unmapped:/scenes/1/motion","unmapped:/scenes/1/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/1/affect","unmapped:/scenes/1/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/1/beings/0/form","unmapped:/scenes/1/beings/0/behaviour"],"schema_version":"0.4.0","_extraction":{"job":"batch-59654eaa6311400fa00712ac545b9d80","phase":"pilot20","attempt":10}}
{"report_id":"k8f9v","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"The writer recounts a personal first experience including body effects and visuals.","scenes":[{"place":"","order":1,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["waiting a few hours, then taking more"],"affect":["hesitant"],"quotes":[{"text":"I got a little body buzz, nothing really visual, but I definitely felt something.","start":354,"end":435,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I took this in about 2 or 3 hesitant hits, just to gauge what it would be like.","start":273,"end":352,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":[],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:hesitant"],"transition_trigger":["other:waiting a few hours, then taking more"],"place":"other:"}},{"place":"lying back in bed","order":2,"light":["weird flashy lights"],"colour":["tons of bright colors"],"motion":["melty walls"],"geometry":[],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":[],"affect":["familiar in a bad way","trapped feeling","a little scary"],"quotes":[{"text":"I lay back in my bed after 2 or 3 hits again, this time I get a lot more body buzz, melty wall visuals, and then tons of bright colors, etc, but no breakthrough.","start":639,"end":800,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"But FUCK this feels familiar in a bad way.","start":802,"end":844,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"The same fuzzy body feeling, the same weird flashy lights","start":1198,"end":1255,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I mean like exactly the same trapped feeling.","start":1800,"end":1845,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"re